  "body": "## What changed\n\nRequested in #191: \"Rather than giving feedback in the error area, clicking new toolpath should take you to the next part of the workflow.\"\n\nA dark Create cell (or a dark row in a section dropdown) that is clicked anyway still names its reason on the status line, and now also opens the fix (view state only - nothing created or queued):\n\n- **no tool, or no tool that fits the kind** → the Tool library page opens (`… - opened the tool library`);\n- **a kind the mounted machine cannot run** → the machine door opens on its workspace list (`… - pick a workspace`).\n\n`gate_route` mirrors `gate_note`'s cases in the same order, so the words and the destination cannot disagree; `follow_gate` replaces the two places that only set the status.\n\nNot done: a WCS route - creating an operation has no WCS gate today (an unplaced slot means G54 at the origin), so there is nowhere to send the user yet. Decision recorded in `RECOMMENDED.md` (#191).\n\n## Gate (own worktree build, current main)\n\n`cargo test -p camcraft-ui`: every binary green except the lib's `egui_shell_snapshot_light` (Diff 1) and `tool_editor_snapshot` (Diff 4) - software-GL pixel diffs with the same counts on main on this machine. `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `egui_app::gate_route_tests::no_tool_routes_to_the_tool_library`\n- `egui_app::gate_route_tests::a_kind_the_machine_cannot_run_opens_the_workspace_list`\n- `egui_app::gate_route_tests::a_live_cell_has_no_route_and_changes_nothing`\n- `egui_app::tests::a_create_cell_darkens_with_the_tool_laws_reason` (extended: the real click lands on the tool library)\n\nChangelog: Clicking a dark operation cell opens the tool library (or the workspace list) instead of only reporting why\n\nOutside contributor PR (fork) - feat, merges at the next cut.\n\nFixes #191\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
